      - ElementName: DestName
        Text: Carpentry Quarter
      - ElementName: DestDescription
        Text: Master Amgad's workshop on the furniture street. Your bench, your tools.
    - Fields:
      - ElementName: RouteCode
        Text: R3
      - ElementName: DestName
        Text: Ras El Bar
      - ElementName: DestDescription
        Text: Where the Nile meets the sea. The lighthouse, the boardwalk, and the
          quietest fishing on the coast.
    - Fields:
      - ElementName: RouteCode
        Text: B3
      - ElementName: DestName
        Text: Ezbet El Borg
      - ElementName: DestDescription
        Text: The fishing town at the river mouth. Trawlers unload at dawn.
    - Fields:
      - ElementName: RouteCode
        Text: S4
      - ElementName: DestName
        Text: The Shipyard
      - ElementName: DestDescription
        Text: Where Damietta still builds boats by hand. Timber, tar, and hulls waiting.
